bslabs btus|(Text) Author: Shantideva (zhi ba lha). Question: For Compendium of Trainings we have several variants. In our current dictionary it is tranlated as "Compendium of Teaching", and in some article it is tranlated as "Compendium of all Disciplines". Should we translate it literally as "Compendium of Trainings"? YES. USE TRAININGS. THIS IS A SPECIFIC TERM BSLAB-PA, AS IN THE THREE HIGHER TRAININGS. TEACHINGS IS BSTAN-PA. FOR EVERY DIFFERENT TIBETAN TERM, YOU NEED AS MUCH AS POSSIBLE A SPECIFIC DIFFERENT RUSSIAN TERM, LIKE I TRY TO DO WITH THE ENGLISH. TRY YOUR BEST NOT TO MIX TERMS. PLEASE READ THIS ARTICLE. IT IS ALREADY IN RUSSIAN ON THE WEBSITE: http://www.berzinarchives.com/web/en/archives/approaching_buddhism/modern_adaptation/recommendations/buddhism_west/guidelines_from_mongolian_experienc.html. Skt: Full: Short: Shikshasamuccaya.
