mched pa|One of the three subtle appearance-making minds.
mchod pa|A tantra ceremony in which specially consecrated offerings are made to honor one's tantric master, inseparable from a Buddha-figure.
mchod pa|Something presented, with respect and the intention to bring happiness and benefit, to someone else.
mchod rten|A monument within which are kept the relics of a great Buddhist master. Translated as a reliquary monument.
