thos pa'i stobs|One of the six powers that one relies on in order to gain the nine stages of shamatha.
thregs chod|The practice, and resultant stage of the practice, in dzogchen during which one "breaks through" the level of limited mind (sems) and both recognizes and accesses essence rigpa, thereby attaining a seeing pathway of mind (path of seeing) and becoming an arya.
