thun drug dang 'brel ba'i dus 'khor bla ma'i rnal 'byor nag 'gros su mdzad pa dpag bsam yongs 'du'i snye ma|(Text) Author: Dalai Lama XIV (rgyal dbang bstan 'dzin rgya mtsho).
